  "body": "Our owners have moved to Australia - Must be SOLD!\r\n\r\nBeautifully proportioned, wonderfully private and set against a lush green backdrop, 48A Waterview Road is a substantial five-bedroom family home with the scale, versatility and setting to suit modern family life.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, the symmetry, wide verandas and Hamptons-inspired design make an immediate impression. The home feels calm and considered, with sea views and surrounding greenery creating a genuine sense of escape.\r\n\r\nInside, generous living spaces are filled with natural light and flow effortlessly onto the outdoor deck, creating an inviting setting for alfresco dining, entertaining friends or simply unwinding at home. With five bedrooms and three bathrooms, there's plenty of room for a growing family, while the downstairs area offers excellent flexibility as a teenage retreat, guest accommodation or a space for extended family.\r\n\r\nStep outside and the setting becomes even more special. A boardwalk leads through established gardens, while the reserve directly at the doorstep feels like a natural extension of the property. It is incredibly quiet, private and surrounded by mature trees, yet still closely connected to the coast.\r\n\r\nThe freehold title adds further appeal, while the location puts Devonport, Takapuna and the wider North Shore within easy reach. Sought-after schooling includes Takapuna Grammar School and Belmont Intermediate.\r\n\r\nThis is a home that offers size without sacrificing warmth, privacy without isolation, and a coastal setting that is increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\n48A Waterview Road is a rare family home with presence, flexibility and a setting that truly is special.\r\n\r\nAuction 19th November at 12pm (Unless Sold Prior) In Rooms, 128 Hurstmere Road, Takapuna\r\n\r\nTo view and download property files go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/L5QD",
